cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Synthetic Gen Z Banking-Experience Dataset — AI Chatbots & Robo-Advisors in Kazakhstan & Central Asia"
abstract: >-
  Complete synthetic-participant corpus (20 evidence-based Gen Z personas ×
  3 large language models × 3 repetitions × 15 interview questions) generated
  for a mixed human-synthetic MSc dissertation testing whether LLM-simulated
  respondents can substitute for real survey participants. Synthetic data
  reproduces thematic content but not the response distribution.
